# Original low-poly Cessna-inspired high-wing, single-engine test plane.
# Stylized geometry, not a manufacturer-supplied model or a scale replica.
# Y is up; the nose points along +Z. Wingspan is 10.4 model units.
# All faces are triangles. Flat normals can be generated by the OBJ viewer.
# Colors are assigned per face with usemtl; no texture images are needed.
mtllib Cessna.mtl
o CessnaTestPlane
s off

